{title: What If It Were Today?}
{artist: Lelia Morris}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 92}

Verse 1
[G]Jesus is coming to [C]earth a[G]gain — what if it were to[D]day?
[G]Coming in power and [C]love to [G]reign — what [D]if it were to[G]day?

Chorus
[G]Glory, glory! Joy to my [D]heart 'twill bring;
[G]glory, glory! [C]When we shall [G]crown him [D]King.
[G]Glory, glory! Haste to pre[C]pare the way —
[G]glory, glory! Jesus will [D]come some[G]day.
